# KatzenVet Admin UI Architecture

Premium corporate dashboard (Stripe/Linear). Full spec: `docs/ADMIN-UI-ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## NEVER violate

1. **No `mat-dialog-title`** — use `<h2 class="admin-dialog-title">` (Material teleports the directive).
2. **Dialog CSS** — target `.admin-dialog-panel` or component `:host`, never `.admin-content`.
3. **Detail labels** — stack vertically; `display: block !important` on label and value.
4. **Actions column** — `mat-column-acciones` fixed `120px`; `mat-icon-button` + `matTooltip` in `.row-actions`.

## Tokens (use CSS vars)

`--katzen-verde`, `--katzen-verde-fuerte`, `--admin-bg`, `--admin-surface`, `--admin-border`, `--admin-radius-sm/md/lg`.

## Refactor checklist

1. Remove layout-breaking Material directives from HTML.
2. Apply `.table-shell` (lists) or `.admin-form-layout` / `.admin-dialog-layout` (dialogs).
3. Primary actions: `.btn-primary-teal` on `mat-raised-button`.

## Dialog config

```typescript
{ width: '840px', maxWidth: '96vw', panelClass: 'admin-dialog-panel' }
```
